<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>It has still to be determined if the donation system is functional: none of the boards in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Single%20Player" title="Single Player (page does not exist)">Single Player</a> module are set up for it and the donation script listed for them does not exist in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Core%20Game%20Resources" title="Core Game Resources">Core Game Resources</a> or Single Player module.
</p>
